				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				777b22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				9.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				455.22
			</span></i>; <i>bisection,</i> Theo Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.184H.
			</span></i>
		</div>
